  "text": "Our study found that silencing PinX1 combined with IR significantly increased CD8+ T cell infiltration and CD8+ cytotoxic T lymphocytes in tumor and peripheral immune organs. CD8+ T cell infiltration and activation strongly correlate with cancer prognosis [44–46], and CD8+ cytotoxic T cell-mediated antitumor immunity is a determinant of ICB efficacy. Radiation-induced DSBs activate the cGAS-STING pathway, promoting CD8+ T cell infiltration and antitumor immunity via tumor-associated antigens and chemokines [43]. Indeed, silencing PinX1 markedly enhanced cGAS-STING activation by increasing IR-induced free dsDNA."
